ENTITY U1_1
QUALIFY U1_1 kind stream
QUALIFY U1_1 type Stream(tau_V)
AT U1_1 I0 V4
AT U1_1 I1 V3
AT U1_1 I2 V2

ENTITY T1_1
QUALIFY T1_1 kind task
QUALIFY T1_1 context CX1
QUALIFY T1_1 input U1_1
QUALIFY T1_1 available_relation R0
QUALIFY T1_1 available_relation R1
QUALIFY T1_1 available_relation R2

UNKNOWN_AT T1_1 X1_1 U1_1 I3 tau_V

CONSTRAINT SAME_RELATION_SUCCESSIVE C1_1 U1_1
QUALIFY T1_1 constraint C1_1
